64.5771-25/473392165_644807838151239_4095123170535035691_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2sbRUjfVZoQ7kNvwExuK9i&_nc_oc=AdppxPLL2Z6qEIcApUVmY71m89aLFplWeSIQ6ex0lagIzM_CVJjfNDmZ0odaGwMLJHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2eDTfMfK3s72pJ0V0FMQLjgWjHXyoStJk6pORMBnowoQ&oe=69E75D47"}, {"file_name": "896976.png", "id": "505172455968203", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392052_505172459301536_9114790666962688767_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8N9bdEc4MTQQ7kNvwEdwic-&_nc_oc=Ado9O6MgTiaW9IBDZUBJB85wt0rc_lPL9fbjFKPiKuG_ZJxjqrGNYxVu5O888a5Bhe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3_PUDw6RC1r05NQym8qqIywHPBuf4RUcFk3p1cu4fhtg&oe=69E77F68"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Certified EV Technician", "keywords": ["EV", "Battery", "Immerselearn", "Training"], "long_description": "Certified EV Technician is an advanced VR training app designed to provide hands-on experience in electric vehicle technology. This interactive simulation covers:\n\n-Types of EVs\n-Battery Technology\n-Electric Motors \n\nTrain in a realistic, risk-free virtual environment to develop critical skills in EV maintenance, troubleshooting, and technology. Whether you're an aspiring technician or a professional looking to enhance your expertise, Certified EV Technician equips you with the knowledge and practical experience needed for the growing EV industry. Start your training today!", "short_description": "Step into the future of automotive technology with Certified EV Technician! This immersive VR training app provides hands-on experience with EV types, battery technology, and electric motors. Learn essential skills in a realistic virtual environment to enhance safety, efficiency, and technical expertise. Perfect for aspiring EV technicians and professionals looking to upskill in the evolving electric vehicle industry."}]}, "developer_name"